{"id":"623231","name":"临川菜梗","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/623231/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芥菜菜梗","amount":"12斤"},{"name":"大蒜梗","amount":"适量（300克左右）"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白酒","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好辣椒面。","img":"images/623231/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜米。","img":"images/623231/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成末。","img":"images/623231/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"准备好芥菜。","img":"images/623231/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取梗，清洗干净。","img":"images/623231/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取适量的蒜梗。","img":"images/623231/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"芥菜梗和大蒜梗都切成小段。","img":"images/623231/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放在太阳底下晒一天（不用晒太干）。","img":"images/623231/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"晒好的菜梗。","img":"images/623231/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加盐，腌一个晚上。","img":"images/623231/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拽干水分。","img":"images/623231/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加糖，辣椒粉、少许白酒拌匀即可，放入无油无水的瓶中，装瓶密封保存。","img":"images/623231/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"腌一个礼拜就可以吃了。","img":"images/623231/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/623231/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"美味的小菜。","img":"images/623231/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}